  "description": "500 Black performers (250 actresses, 250 actors) with verified vital data (birth dates on 392 rows, birthplaces on 383, occupations on 410) and a full AEO layer per row. 413 rows are verified against Wikidata/Wikipedia; 87 GAP rows have no Wikidata item and no English Wikipedia article \u2014 CultureTechLens is their source of record. Seeded from the founder's Listal lists (S1 217, S2 237, D1-only 33, D2-only 13), which every row credits; this dataset is the named successor to the Listal copy job, closed by the founder's decision on 2026-11-16. 13 rows carry an unresolved MODEL-ONLY SUSPECT flag (\u00a74.4), shipped as-is.",
  "keywords": [
    "Black actors",
    "Black actresses",
    "performers",
    "Wikidata",
    "AEO",
    "film",
    "television",
    "CultureTechLens"
  ],
  "distribution": [
    {
      "@type": "DataDownload",
      "encodingFormat": "text/csv"
    },
    {
      "@type": "DataDownload",
      "encodingFormat": "application/json"
    },
    {
      "@type": "DataDownload",
      "encodingFormat": "application/x-sqlite3"
    }
  ]
}